# Avatar

Avatars represent people or workspaces. If an image is unavailable or fails to load, the component renders its fallback initials.

<DocsExample title="Avatar" source={avatarExampleSource} htmlSource={avatarExampleHtmlSource}><AvatarExample /></DocsExample>

Use `size="sm"`, the default size, or `size="lg"`. Images load lazily by default; set `loading="eager"` only when an avatar is immediately visible and important. Always provide meaningful `alt` text when the image carries identity information.
